### Request 1: Create a book
### Response
### Status Code: 201
### Body: JSON for creating a book
POST http://localhost:3000/books HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "title": "Book Title",
    "author": "James Reed",
    "date": "2024-08-11",
    "note": "This book was fun.",
    "mark": true
}

### Request 2: Edit a book
### Response
### Status Code: 201
### Body: JSON replace
POST http://localhost:3000/books HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "title": "Book Title",
    "author": "James Reed",
    "date": "",
    "note": "",
    "mark": false
}

### Request 3: Create a book
### Response
### Status Code: 201
### Body: JSON for creating a 2nd book
POST http://localhost:3000/books HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "title": "Apple",
    "author": "",
